{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02635","headline":"游仙四首 四 · 王绩","name":"游仙四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真经知那是，仙骨定何爲。\n许迈心长切，嵇康命似奇。\n桑疎金阙迥，苔重石梁危。\n照水然犀角，游山费虎皮。\n鸭桃闻已种，龙竹未经骑。\n爲向天仙道，栖遑君讵知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02635.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02635","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}